SUMMARY:Feast of Profitis Ilias monastery\, Pyrgos
LOCATION:Pyrgos\, Santorini\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The monastery of Profitis Ilias on Santorini's highest point above Pyrgos celebrates on 19-20 July with a vespers on the eve and the liturgy on the day\, followed by kerasmata for pilgrims and a panigiri down in Pyrgos with local wine\, food and music. The road up is narrow and parking at the top is scarce\; go early or walk up from Pyrgos.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/santorini/#pyrgos-feast-of-profitis-ilias-monastery-pyrgos
